    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5710" root="جزع" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَزِعٌ</span></b>  (Msb, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَازِعٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَزُعٌ</span></b>  (K)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَزُوعٌ</span></b>  (Msb, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُزَاعٌ</span></b>  (K) part. ns.
of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَزِعَ</span>; [<i>Impatient;</i> &amp;c.;] (Msb, K;) but the
last two have an intensive signification [<i>very
impatient,</i> or <i>having much impatience;</i> &amp;c.].
(IAar.)

